                                "sense_id": "7b64265d-dba3-3c17-8a87-a7919f7fe6c4",
                                "text": "\"The instances you have quoted,\" replied the other, \"are certainly very encouraging! Homer past a life in blindness and beggary; Columbus, in vain solicitation and feverish disappointment; and Luther's was spent in struggle, imprisonment, and danger..."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
